<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>
        <%= botName %> Terminal
    </title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/glitch-docs.css">
</head>

<body>

    <!-- Screen Scanlines -->
    <div class="scanlines"></div>

    <!-- Mobile Toast Notification -->
    <div id="toast">Copied to clipboard</div>

    <main class="terminal-container">

        <!-- Glitch Header Box -->
        <header class="glitch-hud-box">
            <div class="hero-mobile-row">
                <div class="skull-avatar-wrap">💀</div>
                <div class="hero-meta">
                    <h1 class="title-text">
                        <%= botName %> CORE
                    </h1>
                    <div class="status-pill-row">
                        <span class="status-pill pill-active">● ONLINE</span>
                        <span class="status-pill pill-cyan">V<%= version %></span>
                        <span class="status-pill pill-cyan">
                            <%= latency %>MS
                        </span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-intro">
                Autonomous discord bot for ATX Family. Powered by low-latency memory models, continuous speed
                minigames, and cross-platform Web Vault EP synchronization.
            </div>
        </header>

        <!-- Scrollable Tab Switcher -->
        <nav class="terminal-tabs">
            <button class="tab-btn active" data-target="tab-commands">Commands</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" data-target="tab-sync">Web Vault</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" data-target="tab-privacy">Privacy</button>
            <button class="tab-btn" data-target="tab-terms">Terms</button>
        </nav>

        <!-- TAB 1: ALL COMMANDS DETAILED -->
        <section class="terminal-panel active" id="tab-commands">

            <div class="section-head">
                <h2>Commands</h2>
                <span class="section-tag">TAP SYNTAX TO COPY</span>
            </div>

            <!-- 1. AI & UTILITIES -->
            <div class="category-block">
                <h3><span>🧠</span> AI & Conversational Tools</h3>

                <div class="cmd-card">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/ai &lt;prompt&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!ai</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Interacts directly with ARIX. Retains conversational
                        context and answers technical, server, or gaming questions.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/ai what are the top winning tactics for ocho?</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/summary [hours]</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!summary</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Reads previous chat messages across the specified timeframe and generates a
                        concise debrief of key conversations, active players, and drama.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/summary hours:6</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/counter &lt;statement&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!counter</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Formulates a logical, tactical, or satirical rebuttal to debunk arguments or
                        playfully counter other members in chat debates.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/counter statement:pc gaming is completely dead</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/factcheck &lt;claim&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!factcheck</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Analyzes rumors, tech claims, or gaming stats, issuing a formal
                        True/False/Misleading verdict with supporting logic.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/factcheck claim:groww charges 20rs per order for equity delivery</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/eli5 &lt;topic&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!eli5</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">"Explain Like I'm 5": Breaks down complex computing, stock trading, or crypto
                        concepts into clear, digestible analogies.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/eli5 topic:How ARIX works</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/translate &lt;text&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!translate</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Translates multilingual chat messages into formatted English
                        outputs for community accessibility.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/translate text:tournament starts sharp at nine</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/remind &lt;time&gt; &lt;task&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!remind</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Queues an automated alert timer (e.g. 10m, 2h) that mentions you in chat when
                        your task or tournament begins.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/remind time:15m task:collect daily web vault EP</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 2. MINI-GAMES & REWARDS -->
            <div class="category-block">
                <h3><span>🎮</span> Live Chat Mini-Games</h3>

                <div class="cmd-card gold-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/quiz</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!quiz</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Spawns a timed general knowledge or gaming trivia question with letter hints.
                        First member to type the answer in chat earns +50 EP.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card gold-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/unscramble</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!unscramble</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Scrambles the letters of a dictionary word. Type the un-jumbled word in chat to
                        win and automatically trigger the next round.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card gold-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/fasttype</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!fasttype</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Generates a high-speed sentence prompt. Tests keyboard and mobile typing speed.
                        First exact match wins EP.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card gold-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/emojigame</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!emojigame</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Displays a sequence of emojis representing a movie, game, or celebrity. Guess
                        the title in chat to claim the reward.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card gold-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/stopgame</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!stopgame</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Halts the active continuous mini-game in the current channel and reveals the
                        un-guessed solution.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 3. SOCIAL DYNAMICS -->
            <div class="category-block">
                <h3><span>🎭</span> Social Radar & Entertainment</h3>

                <div class="cmd-card pink-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/lovemeter &lt;target&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!lovemeter</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Calculates romance and friendship chemistry percentages between two members,
                        complete with visual progress hearts and a witty verdict.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/lovemeter target:@Member</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card pink-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/aura [target]</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!aura</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Scans chat behavior and generates a daily aura diagnostic (-10,000 to +10,000
                        points) based on current server status.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card pink-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/roast [target]</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!roast</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Delivers a savage, playful, and situational burn targeting gameplay blunders or
                        chat quirks.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card pink-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/flirt [target]</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!flirt</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Sends ultra-smooth or humorously awkward pick-up lines designed for community
                        laughs.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card pink-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/truthdare [mode]</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!truthdare</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Prompts spicy truths or chaotic server dares for voice channels and text group
                        hangouts.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card pink-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/tossacoin</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!tossacoin</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Provably fair random 50/50 flip to settle disputes, bets, or match matchups.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- 4. IDENTITY & TELEMETRY -->
            <div class="category-block">
                <h3><span>👑</span> Identity, Vault & Safety</h3>

                <div class="cmd-card green-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/profile [target]</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!profile</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Displays operator HUD showing level progression, messages dispatched, games won,
                        birthday records, and unified EP balances.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card green-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/balance</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!balance</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Quick telemetry check detailing your exact bot EP balance, website vault XP, and
                        combined net total.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card green-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/connectweb &lt;code&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">Slash Only</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Binds your Discord User ID to your ATX Web account using the 6-digit token from
                        your online profile. Locked strictly to the ATX server.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/connectweb code:782194</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card green-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/report &lt;reason&gt; [target]</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">Ephemeral Slash</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Dispatches an encrypted incident log directly to the admin terminal. The
                        response is visible only to you, and your identity is scrubbed from the report.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/report reason:unauthorized scam link posted in general</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card green-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/setbirthday &lt;DD/MM&gt;</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!setbirthday</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Registers your birthday in the server registry for automatic birthday
                        announcements and perks.</p>
                    <div class="cmd-example">/setbirthday date:15/08</div>
                </div>

                <div class="cmd-card green-accent">
                    <div class="cmd-header">
                        <span class="cmd-syntax">/rules</span>
                        <span class="cmd-badge">!rules</span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="cmd-desc">Prints the 6 core laws of ATX Family covering respect, anti-spam, NSFW bans, and
                        link safety.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="action-btn-row">
                <a href="https://discord.gg/pjzdHKS6Jj" target="_blank" class="action-link btn-primary">Join ATX
                    Server</a>
                <a href="https://atx-family.onrender.com" target="_blank" class="action-link btn-secondary">Web
                    Platform</a>
            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- TAB 2: WEB VAULT SYNC -->
        <section class="terminal-panel" id="tab-sync">
            <div class="section-head">
                <h2>Web Vault Integration</h2>
                <span class="section-tag">UNIFIED EP</span>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>How Synchronization Works</h3>
                <p>ARIX maintains a dual-ledger telemetry pipeline connecting the Discord with the
                    official ATX Web Platform:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Bot EP:</strong> Earned via continuous mini-game victories (+50 EP), active chat
                        milestones, and server events.</li>
                    <li><strong>Website Vault XP:</strong> Earned via daily web logins, EP games and platform
                        quizzes.</li>
                    <li><strong>Combined Net:</strong> Aggregated balance automatically rendered on your live
                        web profile.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>3-Step Linking Guide</h3>
                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Log into <a href="https://atx-family.onrender.com" target="_blank"
                        style="color:var(--accent-cyan);">atx-family.onrender.com</a> with your Google Account.</p>
                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Navigate to your Profile page to generate your single-use <strong>6-digit
                        verification code</strong> (valid for 5-10 minutes).</p>
                <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> In the official <strong>ATX Discord Server</strong>, run the command:</p>
                <div class="cmd-example" style="font-size:0.8rem; padding:0.5rem;">/connectweb code:YOUR_6_DIGIT_CODE
                </div>
                <p style="margin-top:0.5rem; font-size:0.7rem; color:var(--text-dim);"><em>Note: For security and
                        anti-exploit enforcement, account linking can only be triggered from the ATX
                        Family Discord server.</em></p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TAB 3: PRIVACY POLICY -->
        <section class="terminal-panel" id="tab-privacy">
            <div class="section-head">
                <h2>Privacy Policy</h2>
                <span class="section-tag">ATX | ARIX 2026</span>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>1. Information Ingestion</h3>
                <p>ARIX processes and retains minimal identifiers required for system function:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Public Discord Identifiers:</strong> User ID, Server Guild ID, and Username (for
                        leaderboard and balance tracking).</li>
                    <li><strong>Message Activity Metrics:</strong> Incremental counters for level progression and XP
                        calculations. Chat contents are processed in memory for conversational responses and never
                        permanently archived.</li>
                    <li><strong>Account Linkage:</strong> One-way binding between Discord ID and Google Web OAuth ID
                        when manually paired by the user.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>2. Anonymity of Reports</h3>
                <p>When executing <code>/report</code>, ARIX uses Discord Ephemeral Interactions. The submitter's
                    identity is stripped before logging to moderation review channels. Staff cannot trace the report
                    origin.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>3. Third-Party Sharing</h3>
                <p>We do not sell, rent, or trade telemetry data to data brokers or advertising networks. Ingestion
                    pipelines communicate exclusively with internal databases and Google AI inference
                    endpoints.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>4. Data Removal</h3>
                <p>Users may request a complete wipe of their telemetry data, chat counters, and linked accounts at any
                    time via an administrative ticket or the web contact terminal.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- TAB 4: TERMS OF SERVICE -->
        <section class="terminal-panel" id="tab-terms">
            <div class="section-head">
                <h2>Terms of Service</h2>
                <span class="section-tag">LEGAL PROTOCOLS</span>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>1. Terms of Acceptance</h3>
                <p>By using ARIX or adding it to your guild, you agree to comply with Discord's Terms of Service and
                    Community Guidelines. Attempting to exploit memory race conditions, spam-triggering rate limits, or
                    abusing automated endpoints will result in an immediate permanent blacklist.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>2. Virtual Currency Nature</h3>
                <p>Experience Points (EP) and Vault XP are purely digital utility tokens designed for server
                    gamification and web leaderboards. They hold zero fiat cash value and cannot be exchanged for real
                    currency.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="doc-section">
                <h3>3. Service Availability</h3>
                <p>ARIX is hosted on 24/7 cloud infrastructure with automatic health monitoring. We do not guarantee
                    uninterrupted uptime during planned API maintenance or database indexing cycles.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <script src="/js/docs.js"></script>
</body>

</html>